        "original_id": "aab6a0c3-7589-5a8f-b5a3-6f7d51f79181",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ruby Bentall, Winston Graham\n- Works: Lark Rise to Candleford, Lost in Austen, Poldark novels, BBC adaptation of Poldark\n- Characters: Minnie, Mary Bennet, Verity Poldark\n- Topics: Poldark series chronology\n\nFacts:\n- Ruby Bentall was born on 3 April 1988 and is an English actress.\n- Ruby Bentall is known for playing Minnie in \"Lark Rise to Candleford\".\n- Ruby Bentall is known for playing Mary Bennet in \"Lost in Austen\".\n- In the 2015 BBC adaptation of Winston Graham's \"Poldark\" novels, Ruby Bentall played Verity Poldark.\n- The \"Poldark\" series comprises 12 novels.\n- The first seven \"Poldark\" novels are set in the 18th century and conclude at Christmas 1799.\n- The remaining five \"Poldark\" novels concern the early years of the 19th century and the lives of the descendants of the previous novels' main characters.",
